# Live Server / Deployment Target

The production server for this project is **https://rmsurveyai.com/**. All backend/website
code deploys here. Remember this without being told again.

- **Live site:** https://rmsurveyai.com/ (WXO — Play. Earn. Win.)
- **API base:** https://rmsurveyai.com/api/v1
- **Repo:** github.com/Yogesh283/UnityTiles · **Deploy branch:** `feat/realtime-tournament-and-ui-fixes`
- **Server path:** `/var/www/UnityTiles`

## What deploys to the server vs. the APK

- **Server (rmsurveyai.com):** `Backend/` (Python FastAPI API), `AdminPanel/` (PHP/Laravel),
  and `Deployment/public/` (website). Only these need a server deploy.
- **APK (NOT the server):** `Unity_Game/` (C#) and `MatchIQ_App/` (React Native app) ship inside
  the Android APK. Server deploy does not affect them — they need a Unity export + APK rebuild.

## Deploy commands

```bash
# 1) Local: push code
git add -A && git commit -m "..." && git push origin feat/realtime-tournament-and-ui-fixes

# 2) Server: run the deploy script (pulls branch, installs deps, restarts matchiq-api)
ssh root@rmsurveyai.com "bash /var/www/UnityTiles/Deployment/deploy-live.sh"
```
